// D&D's location-tracking rider (while concentrating, the caster always
// knows the target's exact position, piercing walls/shadow) is dropped: the
// closest existing primitives (RemoteSensing/SeeInvisible) anchor a sense or
// pierce concealment generically, neither builds a live position-link to one
// specific already-targeted entity -- that link is new engine work, out of
// Lane A scope. Ships as a straightforward single-target psychic bolt; the
// sheet's Concentration(60) existed only to gate the dropped tracking, so
// with nothing left to concentrate on this ships as Instant.
BasicRanged(
    energy_cost: 45.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    projectile: (
        kind: Simple,
        attack: Some((
            damage: 22,
            damage_kind: Psychic,
        )),
    ),
    projectile_body: Object(BoltFire),
    projectile_speed: 55.0,
    num_projectiles: Value(1),
    meta: (
        school: Some(Divination),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 2 spell -> min_level 12, the `level * 6` convention (see
        // sleep.ron).
        requirements: (min_level: Some(12)),
    ),
)
